# Build and test artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Runtime state: machine-written and volatile, and the design treats .orchestrator/ as "not packaged".
# The protected list is deliberately NOT here: it lives at .github/protected.txt, because a list that
# is not versioned is simply absent on a fresh clone, and every rule that reads it still looks correct.
.orchestrator/
